# kin/child/head/nose_button: the child's button nose
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to KIN-CHILD in wave 2). The child, 21 px (STYLE_P2 3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role nose button
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -6 -7
|r

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -12 -7
|q

view L key rest origin 0 -7
|q
